+---
+id: task-001-fix-order-validation-and-pricing
+type: task
+title: "Fix order validation and pricing"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement the three reported order-service defects while preserving the documented business rules.
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+- Product lookup accepts a SKU regardless of letter case and ignores surrounding spaces; returned
+  product SKUs remain upper-case.
+- An order with discounted goods of exactly €50.00 receives free shipping.
+- VAT for each goods line is rounded half up to the cent; in particular, €1.99 at the standard
+  22% rate has €0.44 VAT.
+- Automated regression tests cover each report and the full test suite passes.
